# The connected Supabase project is supplied by the platform secrets:
# VITE_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, SUPABASE_URL and
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (delivered via /run/base44/app.env). Every client
# reads those names first, so nothing here should name a project.
#
# Deliberately empty: this file used to point at a project that has since been
# deleted, and that stale URL silently won over the platform secret — the browser
# then failed to reach the dead host and sign-in reported "Failed to fetch".
# Leave these blank; put values in the app's environment variables instead.
SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=""
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=""
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
